{
  "name": "Data Recipe: Bulk-upscale product images from Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bulk-upscale product images from a Google Sheet\nReads image URLs from a sheet, upscales every row that has no result yet with the [AI Image Upscaler](https://apify.com/fast_data_asap/ai-image-upscaler) (Real-ESRGAN, 4x), saves the files to Google Drive and writes the links back into the sheet.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Sheet tab `Images` with the header row `image_url, upscaled_url, size, status`.\n2. *Upscale images* and *Download result*: Header Auth credential `Authorization` = `Bearer <Apify API token>`.\n3. Connect Google Sheets (3 nodes) and Google Drive; pick spreadsheet and Drive folder.\n4. Click **Execute workflow**. Run it again any time: finished rows are skipped.\n\nCost: $0.015 per upscaled image ($15 per 1,000). Failed images are free.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 540
      },
      "id": "485fcff2-1605-5d47-b31d-63cef26e96d2",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "5de05e1d-7000-58e7-a1e2-5922a3839057",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Images",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3c168460-f52e-555b-ae32-d149d4930277",
